    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e1949b05c851f091b7fe1b7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她认真的眼神里燃起了火。我的担心是多余的，\n她丝毫没有气馁。我为她如此快速的振作感到惊讶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df997b442e9fb66c81ca66546cc4ae8679a07433f3c239d9affa8776b5213057",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
