    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:deb5d4d36091a38fd5bb2cd8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然时间上不充裕，但她还是以超乎想象的集中力，\n完成了我交给她的训练安排。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14edfa585dc48d8725999fe9ce0c70949fbabe71646099fbb6c9985791332a51",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1088/storytimeline_041088004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d30e3927b52278cacbef6629",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且，这场雨并非不利条件，反而是有利条件。\n想起遇到她那天我就明白了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbdc0b3ccfa7c359ddc479b16baffd29923d7309f40460892f157be0cc77f528",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1088/storytimeline_041088004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41ec89641797962d92f636a3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看到她在重马场那段犀利的加速我就一见钟情了。\n恐怕里见皇冠，她是“道恶巧者”……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88e8384b6d069c359c0cdfaaf4e79aff22ac8303cf6a86ad7a016908dae5783c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1088/storytimeline_041088004.json",
      "json_path": [
